    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Charity is a responsive, feature-rich theme built for NGOs, non-profits, fundraising websites, donation campaigns, charity foundations, churches, and social causes seeking a professional online presence. With one-click demo import, users can quickly set up a complete charity website with pre-built sections such as banners, donation campaigns, fundraising products, volunteer highlights, and a blog to share updates. The theme integrates with the Charitable plugin for managing online donations, creating campaigns, and tracking fundraising goals, while Contact Form 7 ensures smooth volunteer signups, donor communication, and inquiries. Optimized for speed, SEO, and mobile responsiveness, Flex Charity guarantees seamless performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Whether for non-profit organization websites, NGO fundraising platforms, church donation sites, or foundation portals, the theme provides essential tools to increase awareness, manage donors, and grow community support effectively. Modern design and practical features make it the ultimate solution for organizations aiming to inspire trust and maximize social impact online."
    },
